4. Fetched, not redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

scripts/setup_third_party.sh clones Irodori-TTS (MIT), EdiTTS and VoiceCraft at
the commits used, applies scripts/editts/edit_content.patch to EdiTTS (an
output-index offset and a torch>=2.6 load flag), and installs qwen-tts 0.1.1,
sox 1.5.0 and coqui-tts 0.27.5 into the script folders that import them. Each
remains under its own license.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Models used but not redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SpeechSplice is training-free; apart from the ROME/MEMIT baselines of Table A5,
which edit encoder weights in memory, it edits no weights. The experiments load
published frozen checkpoints from their original sources
(scripts/download_models.py lists them with the revisions used); none of them
are redistributed in this repository, and each remains under its own license
and terms of use. They include the ten TTS systems of Table 3 (T5Gemma-TTS,
SpeechT5, LongCat-AudioDiT, Irodori-TTS, Kiseki-TTS, Qwen3-TTS, XTTS-v2 (Coqui
Public Model License), Llasa-3B, CSM-1B, Bark), XCodec2, VoiceCraft, EdiTTS
(Grad-TTS), Whisper large-v3, large-v3-turbo and medium.en, Furigana Whisper,
whisper-pinyin, wav2vec2-xlsr-53-espeak-cv-ft, WavLM-SV, and UTMOS22.

